sequenceDiagram
    %% SD7 - Manage previous games
    %% Stories: 16, 17, 18, 19, 20
    %% Description: The moderator finds a previous game, views its transcript, can export it as HTML or CSV, and can delete the game with its items and estimates.
    actor M as Moderator
    participant G as Game
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item

    M->>G: browse previous games [16]
    G-->>M: list of games
    M->>G: open transcript of a game [17]
    G->>R: getItems() for each round
    R->>I: getAcceptedEstimate() for each item
    G-->>M: transcript of items and estimates
    opt export the transcript [18, 19]
        M->>G: export as HTML or CSV
        G-->>M: transcript file
    end
    opt delete the game [20]
        M->>G: delete game
        G->>R: delete() for each round
        R->>I: delete() for each item, with its estimates
    end
